  message: "Done in PR #2336 (dev 1783b996d), with the owner's approval given in session on 2026-11-22 (governance file, merged by auto-pr without --gov as approved).\nWhat changed in .agent/agent_playbooks_protocols_sops_skills/smart-test-playbook.md: (1) the by-statement paragraph's refusal list gains a new decorated def and a new method of an existing class whose bases are not all source of this repository, and says what a new method with followable bases selects; (2) a new paragraph states that a run given test paths gates no coverage, prints NOT GATED (explicit run) with the changed source files' percent and missing lines, that --gate-changed enforces 100%, and that a run with no test paths always gates; (3) the usage block lists the two forms.\nEvidence: each statement was read against scripts/smart-test (header lines 49-63, explicit_changed_coverage) and statement_select._new_def / statement_narrow._refusal at 8c2159eab. Docs only, so no behaviour was run for this item; the behaviour itself was measured in PR #2334.\nNot done: the hook summary of this playbook in .agent/hooks/_shared/on_transcript_change.py does not state the changed behaviour and was left as it is."  # 939f
